---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure | Access Free Tools"
  description="Learn how Access Free Tools handles advertising, affiliate links, product callouts, and sponsored relationships."
  path="/advertising-disclosure/"
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Advertising Disclosure</p>
    <h1>Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p>Tools stay free. Clearly disclosed advertising can help cover hosting and testing.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section content-section-narrow legal-copy">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 20, 2026</p>

    <h2>HilltopAds advertising</h2>
    <p>
      Access Free Tools shows ads from HilltopAds to help cover hosting and testing. Each public page
      has one labeled banner near the end and may show a small notification-style ad that you can
      close. We do not use pop-unders or full-page ads.
    </p>
    <p>
      HilltopAds chooses the advertiser. An ad is not a recommendation or an endorsement of the
      product or claim shown. Ads stay off private admin pages and APIs, and they never change a
      tool's formulas or results. You do not need to view or click an ad to use any tool.
    </p>
    <p>
      Visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland are asked first, and ads load only after they accept.
      See <a href="/privacy-policy/#ad-choices">your ad choices</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      HilltopAds is the only ad network on this site. Access Free Tools does not run Google AdSense
      or Infolinks.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      No affiliate campaign is active. In future, I may add a clearly identified affiliate link and
      earn a commission when someone chooses to buy through it, at no extra cost to that person.
      Affiliate disclosures should appear close to affiliate links so the relationship is clear
      before anyone decides to open one.
    </p>
    <p>
      Ads, affiliate links, and product previews do not change calculator formulas or results.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      For advertising or affiliate disclosure questions, use the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      page or email <a href="mailto:contact@accessfreetools.com">contact@accessfreetools.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
